        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$2\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{5}\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{5}=\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{5}\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{5}=2\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{5}=\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{5}$",
          "worked": "Since $\\sin\\left(\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)=\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{5}$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{LHS}&=2\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{5}\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\\\&=2\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\\\&=\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{5}\\\\&=\\mathrm{RHS}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p15-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\cos^2\\frac{4\\pi}{7}-\\sin^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}=\\cos\\frac{6\\pi}{7}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\cos^2\\frac{4\\pi}{7}-\\sin^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}=\\cos^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}-\\sin^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}=\\cos\\frac{6\\pi}{7}$",
          "worked": "Since $\\cos\\left(\\pi-\\frac{3\\pi}{7}\\right)=-\\cos\\frac{3\\pi}{7}$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\mathrm{LHS}&=\\cos^2\\frac{4\\pi}{7}-\\sin^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}\\\\&=\\left(-\\cos\\frac{3\\pi}{7}\\right)^2-\\sin^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}\\\\&=\\cos^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}-\\sin^2\\frac{3\\pi}{7}\\\\&=\\cos\\frac{6\\pi}{7}\\\\&=\\mathrm{RHS}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 33
      }
    ]
